<title>USA: Yields rise on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</title>
<headline>Yields rise on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields on all three of the Bond Buyer municipal bond indices rose nine basis points this week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 20-bond index of general obligation bonds calculated Thursday was 5.65 percent, up nine basis points from last week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 11-bond index of GO bonds was 5.55 percent, also nine higher than last week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 30-year revenue bond index was 5.93 percent, up nine.</p>
<p>20 Bond Index			5.65%   5.56%  2/27/97</p>
<p>11 Bond index			5.55%   5.46%  2/27/97</p>
<p>Revenue Bond Index		 5.93%   5.84%  2/27/97</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
